cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SEEM Geo in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SEEM Geo: Professional ERT & MASW Processing Suite for Linear-Infrastructure Site Investigations"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for processing field-acquired Electrical Resistivity Tomography
  (Wenner-alpha) and Multichannel Analysis of Surface Waves data. Produces inverted
  resistivity sections, Vs(z) profiles, Vs30 and local site classification,
  an 8-correlation geotechnical-geophysical framework with full statistical
  qualifications, fence diagrams, Google Earth KMZ exports, and thesis-ready
  58-page PDF reports.
